OL,3,GNEWSAAirport staff 'don't feel safe' at
OL,4,Awork due to abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Unite union representative who works
OL,7,Fat Gatwick Airport says verbal abuse
OL,8,Ffrom passengers can be so bad that
OL,9,Fstaff "don't feel safe in our own
OL,10,Fjobs".
OL,12,FAccording to a recent Union survey of
OL,13,Faround 1,800 people from across the
OL,14,Fprofession, abuse and harassment are
OL,15,Fwidespread in the aviation sector,
OL,16,Fincluding at Gatwick.
OL,18,FPolly Richardson, who works in special
OL,19,Fassistance at Gatwick, said the abuse
OL,20,Foften becomes "personal", but staff
OL,21,F"have to take it, because we're told
OL,22,Fthat the passenger's right".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
