OL,3,GNEWSAAirport staff 'don't feel safe' at
OL,4,Awork due to abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA London Gatwick spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"The safety and security of London
OL,8,FGatwick staff and passengers is always
OL,9,Four top priority. No staff member
OL,10,Fshould face verbal or physical abuse."
